<title>INDIA: India TELCO denies bonus rumour.</title>
<headline>India TELCO denies bonus rumour.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest truck maker Tata Engineering and Locomotive Company Ltd (TELCO) on Friday discounted rumours it was planning a bonus equity issue.</p>
<p>&quot;There's no truth in bonus issue rumours,&quot; one company official told Reuters.  </p>
<p>TELCO shares jumped seven percent to 463 rupees at noon on rumours the company would shortly consider a bonus issue, traders said.</p>
<p>At 12.30 p.m. (0700 GMT) the share was trading at 454, up 20 rupees from Thursday's close.</p>
<p>--Bombay equities desk +91-22-265-9000</p>
